{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794857754581081071,"compiled_state":{"alias":"warmish-primordial-neontetra","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"6b91dc543f5347d2ad443d4f3ce79ca69db4570ea767b3103d6709a61a341b29","event_uuid":"bfeefe91-9f65-4f67-bf27-3b2a7d7a7c0d","position":{"commit_sha":"20cbee0297d4ec6664e16a573dc5fd9c887bac00","position":"1794857643240118451-bfeefe91-9f65-4f67-bf27-3b2a7d7a7c0d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"209d59e56bf5208291f67294989409e113a9a09ef5ec42ac77f60e0dd560d74c","event_uuid":"d828e701-850a-40f2-a8ba-73c1143ff56a","position":{"commit_sha":"80591d22574be55b7f4d7c6de32a240d88d0a7d2","position":"1794857754581081070-d828e701-850a-40f2-a8ba-73c1143ff56a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794857643240118451,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d828e701-850a-40f2-a8ba-73c1143ff56a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6798-606d-37dc-46e7"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nDiscovered from majestic-depilatory-beetle. The advisory `sweep (windows)` job runs a maintained subset held green: tests known to fail on Windows are deselected through `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/posix-api.args`. This bug owns that file: 28 tests in 16 modules, from the 5 scheduled runs at `b4e0d01b649` (2026-11-15/16). It includes `tests/unit/test_bridge_runner_spawn.py`, which fails at collection (`--ignore`) on `signal.SIGKILL`.\n\n`fcntl.flock` (`AttributeError: None has no attribute 'flock'`), `signal.SIGKILL`, `os.getuid`/`os.geteuid` and `subprocess.DETACHED_PROCESS` stubs are used in code or tests that run on Windows.\n\nLargest modules: `tests/unit/test_lock_stale_reclaim.py` (6), `tests/unit/test_spawn_detached.py` (4), `tests/unit/test_gate_admission_09da.py` (2), `tests/unit/test_gate_peak_rss_9ea3.py` (2), `tests/unit/test_live_dc_pass_health.py` (2).\n\n## Approach\n\nGuard each use on the capability (`hasattr(signal, \"SIGKILL\")`, etc.) or give Windows its own leg, as `src/rebar/_store/lock.py` did. Where the behaviour is POSIX-only by design, skip the test on the missing capability.\n\n## Scope\n\nThe failing product or test code for this class, plus `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/posix-api.args` (remove each fixed line; delete the file and its `@` reference in `.github/workflows/test.yml` once empty).\n\n## Testing\n\nPOSIX: the touched tests still pass under `make verify`. Windows: a `sweep (windows)` run on main after the change passes with the removed lines no longer deselected.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The class's root cause is recorded on this ticket with the evidence that confirmed it.\n- [ ] Every line removed from `posix-api.args` names a test that passed (or skipped with a capability reason) in a `sweep (windows)` run on main after the fix (run id recorded in a comment).\n- [ ] `sweep (windows)` concludes `success` on that run.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"4357-c54c-71b0-4bb4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep: POSIX-only APIs used without a Windows path (28 tests)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bfeefe91-9f65-4f67-bf27-3b2a7d7a7c0d","d828e701-850a-40f2-a8ba-73c1143ff56a"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794857754581081071,"uuid":"a55f2cd0-98b2-410e-b6bc-f98dd9095204"}